# Inventory Management and Online Shopping System
## Project Progress Update

### Project Overview
Our team is developing an Inventory Management and Online Shopping System. The purpose of this project is to create an online storefront where customers can browse products, create accounts, manage shopping carts, and place orders. MySQL will be used to store and manage the system's information.

## Current Project Progress

### 1. Website Development
- Started developing the website using JetBrains.
- Began creating the main website structure and pages.
- Started working on the product catalog and shopping features.

### 2. Database Development
- Started developing the MySQL database.
- Began organizing the database structure.
- Identified the main tables needed for products, inventory, customers, orders, and sales.

### 3. API Development
- Prepared API endpoints for the online storefront.
- Added routes for displaying and searching products.
- Prepared product category endpoints.
- Prepared customer registration and login endpoints.
- Added customer profile management endpoints.
- Prepared shopping cart functionality.
- Added checkout and order management endpoints.
- Prepared the API for hosting through Render.

### 4. GitHub Documentation
- Updated the repository with current project progress.
- Added updated team responsibilities and milestone tasks.
- Documented the API endpoints.
- Continued organizing project files and development updates.

## API Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| Products | Display, search, and retrieve products |
| Categories | Display product categories |
| Customer Accounts | Register, log in, and manage profiles |
| Shopping Cart | View, add, update, and remove products |
| Checkout | Calculate checkout subtotal |
| Orders | Place orders and view order history |

**API Hosting Platform:** Render


*Note: API routes have been prepared and documented. Deployment and functionality still need to be verified. Payment processing is not included.*

